[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: REQ-API-001 · Acceptance criteria

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @requirements

[ACCEPTANCE_CRITERION]
UID: REQ-API-001.AC-1
STATEMENT: A valid addition request is answered with HTTP status 200, Content-Type application/json, and a JSON object whose only field is "result", holding a JSON string.
VERIF_LEVELS: integration, system
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-API-001

[ACCEPTANCE_CRITERION]
UID: REQ-API-001.AC-2
STATEMENT: The same request body sent to /api/v1/add, /api/v1/subtract, /api/v1/multiply and /api/v1/divide is answered with the sum, difference, product and quotient of a and b respectively.
VERIF_LEVELS: integration, system
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-API-001

[ACCEPTANCE_CRITERION]
UID: REQ-API-001.AC-3
STATEMENT: Every result is a canonical decimal string: "1.50" + "1.50" gives "3", "007" + "0" gives "7", and "-0" + "0" gives "0".
VERIF_LEVELS: integration, system
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-API-001

[ACCEPTANCE_CRITERION]
UID: REQ-API-001.AC-4
STATEMENT: A POST to /api/v1/<operation> with an operation other than add, subtract, multiply or divide is answered with HTTP status 404 and no result.
VERIF_LEVELS: integration, system
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-API-001

[ACCEPTANCE_CRITERION]
UID: REQ-API-001.AC-5
STATEMENT: A request to /api/v1/add with a method other than POST (GET, PUT, DELETE) is answered with HTTP status 405 and no result.
VERIF_LEVELS: integration, system
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-API-001

[ACCEPTANCE_CRITERION]
UID: REQ-API-001.AC-6
STATEMENT: A request body with fields in addition to "a" and "b" is calculated as if the extra fields were absent.
VERIF_LEVELS: integration, system
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-API-001
